# Checksum-verified cache and generated trees. Both are fully reproducible
# from manifest.toml + roster.toml, and together run to several GB.
# downloads/ and workspaces/ are symlinks to smash-mods-data/ — a trailing
# slash only matches real directories, so the symlinks themselves are
# ignored via the no-slash entries below (matches the link, not its target).
downloads/
build/
workspaces/
/downloads
/workspaces

# Fixture workspaces created by tests/test_verify.py (cleaned up on success,
# left behind if a test crashes).
workspaces/_fixture_*

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.tmp/

# smash-mods CLI (uv-managed venv; uv.lock IS committed for reproducibility)
.venv/

# Personal curation picks (added characters, reskins, NSFW swaps) -- changes
# independently of the tooling and isn't something to publish. See
# roster.toml.template for the schema; copy it to roster.toml and populate
# by hand or with `smash-mods curate ...`.
roster.toml
